 Diego contains 3 academic programs.\nDoctoral\nUndergraduate\nContiguous BS/MS\nNews and Highlights\nView All News\nSep 22\nNew Children\u00e2\u0080\u0099s Book Puts Evolutionary Biology in the Spotlight\nSep 23\nJulian Schroeder Honored with Plant Biology Lifetime Achievement Award\nAug 20\nResearchers Use AI to Decode Key DNA Sequence in Gene Activation\nDepartments\nInvestigating questions addressing how cells assemble and function, and how they are sculpted into complex organisms.\nCell and Developmental Biology\nPursuing molecular mechanisms underpinning a range of fundamental processes vital for life on Earth.\nMolecular Biology\nResearching ecological and evolutionary processes underlying individuals, populations, species and communities.\nEcology, Behavior & Evolution\nProbing how nervous systems work and the rich complexity of mechanisms that influence how we think, feel and act.\nNeurobiology\nStay in touch\nFacebook\nYouTube\nTwitter\nLinkedIn\nUC San Diego 9500 Gilman Dr. La Jolla, CA 92093 (858) 534-2230\nCopyright \u00c2\u00a9 2026 Regents of the University of California.\nAll rights reserved.\nAccessibility\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Use\nFeedback", "links": [["Skip to main content", "https://biology.ucsd.edu/#main-content"], ["School of Biological Sciences", "https://biology.ucsd.edu/"], ["School of Biological Sciences", "https://biology.ucsd.edu/"], ["UC San Diego School of Biological Sciences", "https://biology.ucsd.edu/"], ["About", "https://biology.ucsd.edu/about/index.html"], ["School Factsheet", "https://biology.ucsd.edu/about/school-factsheet.html"], ["News", "https://biology.ucsd.edu/about/news/index.html"], ["Events", "https://biology.ucsd.edu/about/events/index.html"], ["Faculty Honors", "https://biology.ucsd.edu/about/faculty-honors/index.html"], ["Contact", "https://biology.ucsd.edu/about/contact/index.html"], ["Research", "https://biology.ucsd.edu/research/index.html"], ["Faculty", "https://biology.ucsd.edu/research/faculty/index.html"],